# Anchored at the root, so `packages/shared/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` was copied in
# — and a stale one is a lie the compiler believes. `tsc --build` reads it,
# concludes the project is already built, emits nothing, and every workspace
# that imports @budget/shared then fails to resolve it. The image build was the
# only thing that ever saw this, because the NAS builds from `git archive`,
# which carries no ignored files.
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Built in the image, never copied into it — the same reasoning as tsbuildinfo.
apps/mcp/bundle/
apps/mcp/bundle-check/
apps/mcp/*.mcpb
